  sum:'A flashback: Zhan Dongyue, eldest young master of the Zhans, sails with Ya\'Xing and Xiao Tian. The water pulls the ship, the compass jerks, and the calm sea gives way to the snow-covered island of Muxue. Dongyue, who has never seen snow, is delighted. A crowd gathers: "Welcome to the island of Muxue, young travellers."',
